RESOLUTION - Authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for Keefe
Cottages Subdivision, a replat of the North ½ of Lot 2, and all of Lots 3 and 4, Block 236, Original
City, Cheyenne, Wyoming (located at the southeast corner of the intersection of Evans Avenue and
E. 22nd Street).  Casey Palma, Steil Surveying Services, agent for the applicants, provided
information regarding the affiliated zone change acted upon earlier in the meeting, noting the re-
zoning of the property provides for retaining existing uses of the property, and advised the plat
includes designation of separate lots for areas currently having garage structures and provides for an
access easement to a shared alley.  During discussion and upon inquiry, Mr. Palma stated the lots are
small in size and any parking area for items such as boats and recreational vehicles would be no
different than other properties; that no additional traffic volume due to the platting action was
foreseen, and that currently there are no construction plans involving the property.  Mr. Shanor
moved to adopt, seconded by Mr. Cook.  Following brief discussion, motion carried.  Voting “yes”
– all members of the governing body present. (#5558)
